      "content": "Thanks, this looks like a solid start. It's definitely clean.\n\nThe only thing is, I'm a bit worried about the automated check. Since it's looking for structural density, if we submit something this short, it might get flagged as \"under-documented\" or \"incomplete\" by the system, even if the content is good. I don't want it getting rejected by the automated gatekeeper.\n\nBefore we finalize, can you expand on the error handling part (the 404s) and maybe flesh out the authentication section a bit more? Just make sure it feels \"substantial\" enough so the system doesn't think we missed anything. Keep it useful, obviously, but we need to make sure it looks like a comprehensive guide to the tool.",
